.Dd August 14, 2026
.Dt FILEES-SERVICE-WC-CORRECTOR 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-service-wc-corrector
.Nd repair ownership of the FileES service working copy
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a tiny set-id-root helper.
It accepts no arguments.
It walks the configured service working copy and the shared
.Pa .service-wc.lock ,
and runs
.Fn lchown
on any path whose UID or GID is not the state account.
It never changes modes or content.
.Pp
Effective UID 0 is required.
The state-account UID must not be 0.
The walk refuses to cross a filesystem boundary and refuses unsupported
file types.
.Pp
.Xr filees-client-entry 8
invokes
.Nm
before a control-plane ticket.
Ordinary workers remain unprivileged.
.Pp
The installed image is
.Sy root : _filees-access
mode 4550.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Xr sysexits 3
values as in
.Xr filees-admin 8 .
On success it prints a JSON object with
.Ic inspected
and
.Ic corrected
counts.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-client-entry 8 ,
.Xr filees-worker 8
